が、本人にはまったく自覚はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は飄々として無責任。 全ての物事を“気に入るか気に入らないか”で判断する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつては軍に所属し、最も多くの魔物を殺している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし彼と同じ戦闘に参加した者は必ず死亡することから、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“味方殺し” “凶戦士” と呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あ～ぁ、いやな渡世だね…… さて、悪いことでも始めましょうか」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54383"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"武器","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54383","value":"錆びた日本刀（無銘）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/792d079cdeb56083adcfcaae5da3c165bbf550adb85d6f0ec7b6a2f7533ebf3b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/5301a9770be3d6306a7335e7d4c694eea452bb37b094e6619331272b138a69c7.webp","width":78,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c61580","characterName":"ヘル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54376","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212276"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16359"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61580"},"originalCharacterName":"ヘル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"ちいさい"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Height: Small"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The goddess of the netherworld. She resurrected the deceased protagonist and gave him a mission as a person who harbors the soul of evil spirit, Loki. She lives in a mansion with beautiful flower garden and seems to be unable to leave the place."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61580"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北欧神話の「ヘル」は冥府の女神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"死亡した主人公を復活させ、邪神・ロキの魂を宿す者としての使命を与える。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16359","sourceWorkId":"25149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"北欧神話の ヘル は冥府の女神。 その半身は死んで腐敗していると言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"死亡した主人公を復活させ、邪神・ロキの魂を宿す者として使命を与える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美しい花園のある屋敷に住み、普段はその場所から出ることができないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「六樹の命は、レギンレイブの命と連結した。 そいつが死ぬと、六樹も死ぬの……　待ってるから」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54376"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"武器","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54376","value":"心を剔る悪口"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/22fe7cc91b96eeb4fa63f03027b576ededd318b6ac5e4c82cd1c62e9b8e6df9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff5fdb7903b0656a0c77a029cc5c8da00fc1c6d87b14b5d109882e48d90ee83e.webp","width":182,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"るび様","creatorId":"vndb:s4248","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4248","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4248","name":"るび様","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212276:54376:30815:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61581","characterName":"ヨルムンガンド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54377","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212276"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16501"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61581"},"originalCharacterName":"ヨルムンガンド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Black kitten that reside in Hela's mansion. Originally one of the evil spirits, but she couldn't find a body during the resurrection, but it is possible to transform into a human body by fusing herself with a body of dead warrior, Gelhilde."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61581"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヘルの館にいた黒い仔猫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"死亡した戦乙女・ゲルヒルデの肉体と融合し人間体に変身できるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゲルヒルデを倒した者の正体は不明……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16501","sourceWorkId":"25149","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヘルの館にいた黒い仔猫。 もとは邪神の一人だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"復活の際に肉体を得ることができなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし死亡した 戦乙女・ゲルヒルデ の肉体と融合し人間体に変身できるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仔猫の姿でも戦乙女である時も主人公をサポートしてくれるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人としての記憶しかない主人公を助けることは、あまり本意ではないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「鰹節？　このヨルがそんなモノで懐柔されるとでも？　まあ……聞きたいことがあれば言ってみるがいい」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54377"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"武器","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"54377","value":"スルーズゲルミル"},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"154 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16501","sourceWorkId":"25149","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52aedd3ceb29bee0c7e3c6ae337f4fa1c45feab692cebe04eec5c3644937c8c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35d70d17e044c06a074482440b8739c9079c73bcd32529f985c3c9382b2109b5.webp","width":157,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"スズナ","creatorId":"vndb:s13137","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13137","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13137","name":"スズナ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73790","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61582","characterName":"ブリュンヒルデ・アルルクラート","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"54378","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212276"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16502"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61582"},"originalCharacterName":"ブリュンヒルデ・アルルクラート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-con